.TH DANBY-YOYO 1
.SH NAME
danby-yoyo \- coupled translation and rotation of a yo-yo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/yoyo
.SH MODEL
Axle radius and rotational inertia add an effective translational mass while
the string unwinds.  At full extension the acceleration reverses to model the
return.  Angular speed is constrained by the no-slip winding relation.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/yoyo.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR mechanism (2)
